}

qs_finish_text() {
  q_say 'You flop onto the couch. The books are on the shelf, the kettle is in the kitchen, the neighbor has a key, and the hallway is clear. Home.

You can now make folders and files (mkdir, touch), move and copy them (mv, cp), throw them out (rm), work on many at once with *, and write into files. That'\''s most of what people do in a terminal every day.'
}

